Z||000012||stsmithgt||02-07-2001||07:12 PM||||I know where you're coming from. I had a awsome german shepard from champion lines.  Ironically, a postman killed him by running him down in his car, in my driveway.  I had a .45 holstered to my belt at the time.  If I ran UP the driveway to the levy instead of DOWN the driveway to the dog near the mailbox, I would have caught him and been in a lot of trouble.  The postman was gone so fast.  I think he saw me pull out my pistol when I saw that he killed my dog(I lived out on a farm that wasn't too safe).  I didn't see him do it so there wasn't enough evidence to prove he did it.  My dog was appraised for $1000.00, but that's not the point.<BR>  I don't have kids or a wife so I know how treating your pets like family is.  Time will heal.  It's just a *****  when it takes so much of it.||||reg||1
